---
title: Hermes Chat V2 — 增量时序图
---

%% ============================================
%% V2-1: @mention 消息路由完整链路
%% ============================================

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MI as MessageInput
    participant MD as MentionDropdown
    participant CS as ChatStore
    participant SS as SocketService
    participant WM as WebSocketManager
    participant MR as MessageRouter
    participant DB as Database
    participant CM as ContextManager
    participant HC as HermesConnector
    participant B1 as Bot A (Hermes)
    participant B2 as Bot B (Hermes)

    Note over User,MI: ═══ 阶段1: @mention 输入补全 ═══
    User->>MI: 输入 "@"
    MI->>MI: 检测 @ 字符 + 光标位置
    MI->>MD: 弹出下拉 (position=光标)
    MD->>CS: 读取 chat.participants[]
    CS-->>MD: Bot[] 列表
    MD->>MD: 渲染候选列表 (名称+头像)
    User->>MD: 选择 "Bot A"
    MD->>MI: 插入 "@Bot A " 到光标处
    MD->>MD: 收起下拉
    User->>MI: 继续输入 "你好，帮我查一下天气"
    MI->>MI: content = "@Bot A 你好，帮我查一下天气"
    MI->>MI: mentions = [{botId:"b1", name:"Bot A"}]

    Note over MI,HC: ═══ 阶段2: 消息发送 + @路由 ═══
    User->>MI: 点击发送
    MI->>CS: sendMessage("@Bot A 你好...", mentions:["b1"])
    CS->>CS: 构建 Message {content, mentions:["b1"], status:SENDING}
    CS->>SS: emitMessage(msg)
    SS->>WM: Socket.IO 'message:send'
    WM->>MR: routeFromFrontend(msg)
    MR->>MR: validateMessage(msg)
    MR->>DB: persistMessage(msg)

    MR->>MR: 检查 msg.mentions

    alt 有 @mentions: ["b1"]
        MR->>MR: routeByMentions → 目标: Bot A only
        MR->>CM: getContext(chatId, "b1")
        CM->>CM: 读取 Bot.contextStrategy
        alt strategy = 'full'
            CM->>DB: 读取全部历史消息
            CM-->>MR: 全量上下文 (最多1000条)
        else strategy = 'recent'
            CM->>DB: 读取最近 N 条 (maxContextMessages)
            CM-->>MR: 最近 N 条上下文
        else strategy = 'model-managed'
            CM->>DB: 读取全部历史消息
            CM->>CM: tiktoken 估算 remainingTokens
            CM-->>MR: 全量上下文 + remainingContextTokens
        end
        MR->>HC: sendMessage("b1", msg + context)
        HC->>B1: WebSocket → Bot A
        Note over B2: Bot B 未收到消息 (未被@)
    else 无 @mentions
        MR->>MR: routeToAll → 遍历 chat.participants
        loop 每个 participant
            MR->>CM: getContext(chatId, botId)
            CM-->>MR: 上下文
            MR->>HC: sendMessage(botId, msg + context)
            HC->>B1: WebSocket → Bot A
            HC->>B2: WebSocket → Bot B
        end
    end

    Note over B1,CS: ═══ 阶段3: Bot 回复回传 ═══
    par Bot A 回复
        B1-->>HC: 回复消息
        HC-->>MR: onMessage("b1", reply)
        MR->>DB: persistMessage(reply)
        MR->>WM: broadcastToChat(chatId, 'message:new', reply)
        WM->>SS: 'message:new'
        SS->>CS: addMessage(reply)
        CS->>CS: 按 senderId 渲染气泡 (Bot A 名称+头像)
    and Bot B 可能也回复 (若消息路由到了B2)
        B2-->>HC: 回复消息
        HC-->>MR: onMessage("b2", reply)
        MR->>DB: persistMessage(reply)
        MR->>WM: broadcastToChat(chatId, 'message:new', reply)
        WM->>SS: 'message:new'
        SS->>CS: addMessage(reply)
        CS->>CS: 按 senderId 渲染气泡 (Bot B 名称+头像, 不同颜色)
    end


%% ============================================
%% V2-2: WIDGET 投票完整回传链路
%% ============================================

sequenceDiagram
    participant Bot as Hermes Bot
    participant HC as HermesConnector
    participant MR as MessageRouter
    participant WM as WebSocketManager
    participant PM as PollManager
    participant DB as Database
    participant FE_A as 用户A 前端
    participant FE_B as 用户B 前端
    participant PW_A as PollWidget (A)
    participant PW_B as PollWidget (B)

    Note over Bot,FE_B: ═══ 阶段1: Bot 发起投票 ═══
    Bot->>HC: 推送 WIDGET 消息
    Note right of Bot: {type:WIDGET, metadata:{widget:{template:poll,
    Note right of Bot:  poll:{question:"午餐吃什么?",
    Note right of Bot:  options:[{id:"1",label:"中餐"},{id:"2",label:"日料"},{id:"3",label:"西餐"}],
    Note right of Bot:  allowMultiple:true, endTime:1700000000000}}}
    HC->>MR: routeFromHermes(botId, rawMsg)
    MR->>MR: validateMessage → type=WIDGET ✓
    MR->>DB: persistMessage(msg)
    MR->>PM: registerPoll("widget-001", options)
    PM->>PM: 初始化 PollState
    Note right of PM: votes: Map{}, isActive:true
    PM->>PM: 若 endTime 存在 → scheduleClose()
    MR->>WM: broadcastToChat(chatId, 'message:new', msg)
    WM->>FE_A: 'message:new' (WIDGET)
    WM->>FE_B: 'message:new' (WIDGET)
    FE_A->>PW_A: 渲染 PollWidget (0票, 未投票)
    FE_B->>PW_B: 渲染 PollWidget (0票, 未投票)

    Note over FE_A,FE_B: ═══ 阶段2: 并发投票 ═══
    FE_A->>PW_A: 用户A 点击 "中餐" + "日料" (多选)
    PW_A->>PW_A: UI 立即反馈 (选中态)
    PW_A->>WM: Socket.IO 'widget:vote'
    Note right of PW_A: {widgetId:"widget-001", optionIds:["1","2"], userId:"userA", chatId:"c1"}
    WM->>PM: castVote("widget-001", "userA", ["1","2"])
    PM->>PM: votes.set("userA", Set{"1","2"})
    PM->>PM: 重新计算 getResults()
    Note right of PM: 中餐:1, 日料:1, 西餐:0
    PM->>WM: broadcastToChat 'widget:result'
    Note right of PM: {widgetId:"widget-001", options:[...], isActive:true}
    WM->>FE_A: 'widget:result'
    WM->>FE_B: 'widget:result'
    PW_A->>PW_A: 更新进度条 (中餐50%, 日料50%, 西餐0%)
    PW_B->>PW_B: 更新进度条 (中餐50%, 日料50%, 西餐0%)

    FE_B->>PW_B: 用户B 点击 "西餐"
    PW_B->>WM: 'widget:vote' {widgetId:"widget-001", optionIds:["3"], userId:"userB", chatId:"c1"}
    WM->>PM: castVote("widget-001", "userB", ["3"])
    PM->>PM: votes.set("userB", Set{"3"})
    PM->>PM: 重新计算 getResults()
    Note right of PM: 中餐:1, 日料:1, 西餐:1
    PM->>WM: broadcastToChat 'widget:result'
    WM->>FE_A: 'widget:result'
    WM->>FE_B: 'widget:result'
    PW_A->>PW_A: 更新进度条 (33%/33%/33%)
    PW_B->>PW_B: 更新进度条 (33%/33%/33%)

    Note over FE_A,FE_B: ═══ 阶段3: 投票截止 ═══
    PM->>PM: 定时器触发 → endTime 到达
    PM->>PM: isActive = false
    PM->>PM: 冻结最终结果
    PM->>WM: broadcastToChat 'widget:closed'
    Note right of PM: {widgetId:"widget-001", finalResults:[...], isActive:false}
    WM->>FE_A: 'widget:closed'
    WM->>FE_B: 'widget:closed'
    PW_A->>PW_A: 禁用投票按钮, 显示最终结果
    PW_B->>PW_B: 禁用投票按钮, 显示最终结果


%% ============================================
%% V2-3: UI Mod 扩展 — ADD_BUTTON + SHOW_MODAL 流程
%% ============================================

sequenceDiagram
    participant Bot as Hermes Bot
    participant WM as WebSocketManager
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant UIS as UIStore
    participant Nav as TopNavbar
    participant Modal as MUI Dialog

    Note over Bot,Nav: ═══ ADD_BUTTON 流程 ═══
    Bot->>WM: 推送 UI_MOD 消息
    Note right of Bot: {type:UI_MOD, uiMod:{type:ADD_BUTTON, payload:"open_dashboard"}}
    WM->>FE: 'message:new' (type=UI_MOD)
    FE->>UIS: applyUIMod(msg.metadata.uiMod)
    UIS->>UIS: 白名单校验 → ADD_BUTTON ✓
    UIS->>UIS: addButton("open_dashboard", {label:"仪表盘", icon:DashboardIcon})
    UIS->>Nav: 触发 TopNavbar 重渲染
    Nav->>Nav: 渲染新按钮 "仪表盘"
    User->>Nav: 点击 "仪表盘" 按钮
    Nav->>FE: emit 'uimod:button-click' {buttonId:"open_dashboard"}
    FE->>WM: Socket.IO 'uimod:button-click'
    WM->>Bot: 回传点击事件
    Bot-->>WM: Bot 可据此推送新消息/打开页面

    Note over Bot,Modal: ═══ SHOW_MODAL 流程 ═══
    Bot->>WM: 推送 UI_MOD 消息
    Note right of Bot: {type:UI_MOD, uiMod:{type:SHOW_MODAL,
    Note right of Bot:  payload:'{"title":"确认操作","body":"确定要执行此任务吗?",
    Note right of Bot:  "actions":[{"label":"确定","actionId":"confirm"},{"label":"取消","actionId":"cancel"}]}'}}
    WM->>FE: 'message:new' (type=UI_MOD)
    FE->>UIS: applyUIMod(msg.metadata.uiMod)
    UIS->>UIS: 白名单校验 → SHOW_MODAL ✓
    UIS->>UIS: showModal({title, body, actions})
    UIS->>Modal: 渲染 MUI Dialog
    Modal->>Modal: 显示标题+正文+按钮
    User->>Modal: 点击 "确定"
    Modal->>FE: emit 'uimod:modal-action' {actionId:"confirm"}
    FE->>WM: Socket.IO 'uimod:modal-action'
    WM->>Bot: 回传操作结果
    UIS->>UIS: closeModal()
    Modal->>Modal: Dialog 关闭

    Note over Bot,FE: ═══ SET_FONT + SET_LAYOUT 流程 ═══
    Bot->>WM: UI_MOD {type:SET_FONT, payload:"JetBrains Mono, monospace"}
    WM->>FE: 'message:new'
    FE->>UIS: setFont("JetBrains Mono, monospace")
    UIS->>FE: 全局 font-family 更新

    Bot->>WM: UI_MOD {type:SET_LAYOUT, payload:"compact"}
    WM->>FE: 'message:new'
    FE->>UIS: setLayout("compact")
    UIS->>FE: 消息间距缩小, 全局重渲染
